# OS metadata. This repo holds only prose, images and issue templates — there is no
# build output to ignore, so junk the filesystem creates on its own is the whole list.
# It matters more here than in a private repo: this one goes public at launch, and a
# stray `git add -A` on a machine that browsed assets/ in Finder would publish it.
.DS_Store
._*

